    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2822" root="بطو or بطى" body-key="b">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَطَا</span></b> , aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَبْطُو</span>, is said by Z and Meyd to
signify <i>He,</i> or <i>it, was,</i> or <i>became, wide:</i> and
hence <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَاطِيَةٌ</span>, meaning a <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَاجُود</span>. (TA.)

